ToGetTheListOfItemsOnDirectSaleOfAGivenPublicationController ..> DirectSaleRepository : uses
ToGetTheListOfItemsOnDirectSaleOfAGivenPublicationController ..> PublicationRepository: uses
PublicationMapper_US023 ..> PublicationDTO_US023 : maps to
'DirectSaleRepository "1 " --> " * " DirectSale : contains
ToGetTheListOfItemsOnDirectSaleOfAGivenPublicationController ..> DirectSaleMapper_US023 : uses
DirectSaleMapper_US023 ..> DirectSaleDTO_US023 : maps to
'DirectSaleMapper_US023 ..> DirectSale : uses
ToGetTheListOfItemsOnDirectSaleOfAGivenPublicationController ..> PublicationMapper_US023 : uses
/'
DirectSale "1" -- "1" Listing : uses
Listing "                                *" -- "1" SaleType : can be sold by
Listing "1" -- "1..*    " Item : lists an
' Item "*" -- "1" BibliographicalData: has
Item "*" -- "1" Publication: refers to a
Publication "*" -- "1" BibliographicalData: has
